
// Aura-Glam
ACTION_IF MOD_IS_INSTALLED ~SETUP-GLAMNPCPACK.TP2~ ~0~
THEN BEGIN
  PRINT ~添加奥拉与《格拉姆NPC合集》的交叉对话~
COMPILE EVALUATE_BUFFER ~%MOD_FOLDER%/dialogue/BGEE/crossmod/glamvrock.d~
END

